It began as a fork of the original project by Deac Karns
(https://github.com/peledies), whose work and design remain at the
heart of this plugin. This distribution adds Homebridge 2.x / HAP 2.x
compatibility, multi-station naming, an opt-in websocket data source,
CO2 / PM2.5 / PM10 sensor coverage, and further features and fixes.

